    {
      "id": "a712f6b8-1e2a-4edc-a9a0-57e839ed1aad",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "fda3164e-ceb4-4699-ae52-2c74dafdf8af",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Dot: One standard\nbatch makes two\nseals from two\nunits. One repair",
                "takes one seal.\nThe next\ninspection needs\ntwo seals. So a\nsingle",
                "batch covers that\ninspection\nexactly. A second\nbatch is a buffer,",
                "not a requirement\nwe should hide."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e50da1cf-9e85-4422-a23d-92d248072e14",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "f5a38ce3-c948-43e3-a8cd-aad4c6694600",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet presents a\nDIFFERENT practice\norder, separate\nfrom the",
                "two-seal standard\ninspection. This\norder needs\nexactly three\nseals,",
                "with no spare\noutput because the\nmix expires. Six\nstock units are",
                "available; two\nmust remain for\nanother crew.\nRecipe A uses two\nstock",
                "for two seals.\nRecipe B uses four\nstock for three.\nOnly whole",
                "batches are\nallowed. The first\nstandard\ninspection and\nthis practice",
                "order must each be\nplanned on their\nown terms."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9476cc48-be25-4c4a-aaab-daa7a1776f36",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b737ec53-3247-4fa9-aa06-d18ea4f4ddd8",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "For the original\nstandard\ninspection, use\nDot two-seal\nrequirement",
                "and the standard\ntwo-seal batch,\nnot the different\npractice recipes.",
                "How many standard\nbatches cover that\ninspection exactly\nbefore",
                "adding a buffer?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "542efe9f-4623-4c8b-af15-57dbf151623c",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "fcdc52f0-3bc0-406b-a6b2-3d95c12f257a",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet offers\nRESERVE, holding\nspare seals for\nsudden faults, or",
                "SHARED, pooling\norders and\npublishing the\nstock ledger. Each\ncan",
                "work if people\nkeep the promise.\nChoose the policy\nthe crew will use",
                "in later tests."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9b2c0635-7641-40fd-a6d6-a3dc400c73be",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "9bb57c0b-1199-4145-a792-d00f7dbc5656",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which recipe plan\nmeets all three\nconstraints:\nexactly three\nseals,",
                "no partial batch,\nand at least two\nstock left? Read\nthe output as",
                "carefully as the\ninput. Two small\nbatches may look\neconomical until",
                "you count what\nthey make. The\nother crew has\nalready planned a",
                "repair around the\nstock you promised\nnot to consume."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "55b855e9-ea3f-43f9-ad22-f24342e42c63",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "54c4d625-4ede-45a1-a057-321ec859f989",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The spring closes\nthe valve with a\nsmall click. Rivet\nrepeats the",
                "test with the\npower\ndisconnected. The\nsame click\nanswers. Pip says",
                "it sounds less\ngrand than\nexpected. Rivet\nsays good safety\nequipment",
                "often has\nexcellent manners."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
